Aurora HD

Aurora HD is a modified RuneLite graphics plugin derived from the 117 HD
project. This repository preserves upstream copyright notices, source-file
headers, third-party asset notices, and the BSD 2-Clause license retained in
LICENSE.

Upstream attribution:

- 117 HD / RLHD and its contributors.
- RuneLite and its contributors, where applicable.
- Third-party asset and shader contributors listed in source headers and in
  src/main/resources/rs117/hd/scene/textures/000_licenses.txt.

Modification notice:

Aurora HD contains modifications for Aurora-owned renderer identity, graphics
presets, water, sky, environmental effects, world-detail material work,
configuration cleanup, performance cleanup, documentation replacement, and
repository identity updates. These changes are modifications of this fork and
should not be represented as original 117 HD work.

